{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-202500-r4506008","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Grilled Lamb Chops","sourcePageId":202500,"sourceRevision":"4506008","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-10T01:57:22Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Grilled%20Lamb%20Chops&oldid=4506008","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:54:35.000Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Grilled recipes","Category:Main course recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using cayenne","Category:Recipes using garlic","Category:Recipes using lamb","Category:Recipes using pepper","Category:Recipes using rosemary","Category:Recipes using salt","Category:Recipes using thyme","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"c39a6a262d802955ad4105ec9fb060f90240aeaa82619c1c9380f6fda9df42f4","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Lamb recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n== Ingredients ==\n* 4 thick-cut bone-in [[Cookbook:Lamb|lamb]] loin chops\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Rosemary|rosemary]], finely [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n* 2 tsp [[Themes in Literature/Isolation and Community/Much Madness|thyme]], finely chopped\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n* Freshly-ground [[Cookbook:Black Pepper|black pepper]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|Tbsp]] smoked [[Cookbook:Paprika|paprika]]\n* ½ head [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]]\n* 4 tsp [[Cookbook:Cayenne Pepper|cayenne pepper]]\n* [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|Olive oil]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Rub the cut side of the halved garlic head all over lamb chops. [[Cookbook:Brush|Brush]] with olive oil and rub seasonings into meat. Refrigerate for at least 1 hour.\n#[[Cookbook:Grilling|Grill]] chops over high heat for 1 ½ minutes. Rotate 90° and cook for another 1 ½ minutes. Flip and repeat these steps on the other side of the chops.\n#Move meat to medium heat and cook, turning often, until internal temperature reaches 140°F for medium rare.\n#Remove and let rest 7 minutes. Serve warm.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using lamb]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rosemary]]\n[[Category:Recipes using thyme]]\n[[Category:Grilled recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cayenne]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pepper]]\n[[Category:Recipes using salt]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Grilled Lamb Chops","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"4 thick-cut bone-in lamb loin chops","sourceText":"4 thick-cut bone-in lamb loin chops","amountText":"4 thick-cut bone-in lamb loin chops","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 tsp rosemary, finely chopped","sourceText":"1 tsp rosemary, finely chopped","amountText":"1 tsp rosemary, finely chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 tsp thyme, finely chopped","sourceText":"2 tsp thyme, finely chopped","amountText":"2 tsp thyme, finely chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"Salt","sourceText":"Salt","amountText":"Salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5